@startuml
!theme plain
title TASK-260715-3661ps — iOS archive and TestFlight sequence

participant "Release orchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "Version allocator" as Version
participant "Protected archive builder" as Builder
participant "Bundle/profile inspector" as Inspector
participant "App Store Connect" as ASC
participant "Physical iPhone" as Device
participant "Release operations" as Ops

Orchestrator -> Version : approved tag + immutable candidate
Version -> ASC : query existing builds
ASC --> Version : monotonic build state
Version --> Orchestrator : marketing version + reserved build number
Orchestrator -> Builder : exact source, locks, relay staging, versions
Builder --> Orchestrator : signed xcarchive/export + hashes
Orchestrator -> Inspector : profiles, entitlements, topology, privacy manifests, symbols
Inspector --> Orchestrator : technical preflight pass
Orchestrator -> ASC : upload exact candidate
ASC --> Orchestrator : processed build ID
Orchestrator -> ASC : assign approved TestFlight group
ASC -> Device : install unchanged processed build
Device --> Orchestrator : entitlement/lifecycle/accessibility evidence
Orchestrator -> Inspector : server + local binary preflight
Inspector --> Ops : accepted build ID + provenance + technical compliance evidence

note over Builder,ASC
No rebuild, resign, profile substitution,
or resource change may inherit TestFlight evidence.
end note
@enduml